    429  0b51							; With the MIDI chip's interrupts (midiIrq, v0.16): the chip interrupts when
    430  0b51							; a byte has come in or the next can go out; the CIA timer ticks each ms.
    431  0b51				   IrqMidi
    432  0b51					      subroutine
    433  0b51		       48		      pha
    434  0b52		       8a		      txa
    435  0b53		       48		      pha
